# Default set of AINA (Projecte Aina / BSC) translation models to download.
#
# One "<huggingface_repo_id> <pair>" per line. The pair is the directory name
# the model is normalized into and the key the translation service uses when
# engine=aina is requested (see serving/translate-service/translate-service.py).
#
# AINA models are published on HuggingFace as CTranslate2 models (config.json,
# model.bin, shared_vocabulary.json) plus a SentencePiece model (spm.model).
# download-aina-models.sh normalizes them into the same on-disk layout the
# Softcatalà models use, so nmt_sc.ctranslate.CTranslate loads them unchanged.
#
# Comment out a line to exclude a model, or use MODELS="eng-cat cat-eng" to
# download only a subset. See models/download-aina-models.sh.

projecte-aina/aina-translator-en-ca eng-cat
projecte-aina/aina-translator-ca-en cat-eng
